  "actual_progress": [
    "143 independently named original typed blocks receive closed lower-key1..77 source-decision terms; frozen actual TypedRange supplies grid400/nonnegative mask. All source indices satisfy E baseGeometry, E licensedIndices=univ, residualIndices=empty. This does not assert strict owner/gate all-pass.",
    "Full source geometry keys are encoded as Nat base400 codes; a single closed source-decision term states sorted codes are adjacent-strict. mergeSort permutation and a proved adjacent-to-Nodup lemma recover ORIGINAL unsorted key Nodup, source-index injectivity and292633 distinct geometry records. No record-value dedup shortcut.",
    "Actual full raw parent lies in the original ambient; fixedParent=originalBox; each source has the genuine complete decoded-cell cover, exact strict-retained/omitted partition and disjointness across source indices including half-open faces.",
    "Same actual common exponent5 is max(NEW actual common fourth ancestor, original source-mask candidate) on each original licensed-owner mesh domain, and equals its own seed off all active sources. The SAME policy8 rank5 query is rewritten, not identified by a policy name.",
    "The actual continuous two-own-cube profile gain and independent finite literalTupleDifference(actualOwnCubeGatedMinusDensity) each decompose over all original indices; actual finite frontier keeps every next candidate and original reciprocal-prime weights.",
    "Independent physical below-mu separation and genuine finite carrier identity bind the complete index sum to original oldGain and production fifthTupleCharge on the true common3 frontier. No finite-Rosser monotonicity, physical-rho identity or limiting density estimate is assumed.",
    "Independent actual22 support-gate and3 canonical-filter proper-affine strips cost at most416*(sum over actual source M_i)*e. Augmented actual old-literal modulus absorbs this rate BEFORE selecting the single e and q, yielding full-index B13 error < eta/2 + real canonical-history-invalid cost + real pointwise-fifth-invalid cost. No child/owner-cardinality multiplier."
  ],
